TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution into acidic solution; compare SI(Witherite) at step 10 vs 100

SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m  1.0
        -parms 1.0  1.0
        -tol 1e-10
        -steps 10 100*10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step si_witherite
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, SI("Witherite")
END
